<title>ROMANIA: Romania Neptun posts lower 6-mth profit.</title>
<headline>Romania Neptun posts lower 6-mth profit.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>						    (in million lei)</p>
<p> Gross profit	 126.20	vs    3,428.25</p>
<p> Turnover	  20,060.91	vs   14,520.67</p>
<p> Total assets    74,433.68	vs   67,975.03</p>
<p> Debts	     36,075.69	vs   29,365.57</p>
<p> Share capital   39,242.00</p>
<p>NOTE - Neptun SA is a state engineering company. Figures, reported according to Romanian accounting standards, were taken from its report to the Bucharest stock exchange.</p>
<p>($=3,177 lei) -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
